<title>UK: Cattles first half pretax rises 17 percent.</title>
<headline>Cattles first half pretax rises 17 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		7.2		    vs 6.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 2.8		    vs 2.45</p>
<p> Pretax		     14.73		  vs 12.58</p>
<p> Turnover		   154.86		 vs 134.47</p>
<p> Operating result	 14.20		  vs 12.32</p>
<p> Tax			  4.90		   vs 4.15</p>
<p> Net taxed		  9.84		   vs 8.43</p>
<p> Pay date		   November 4</p>
<p> Div registration date  September 24</p>
<p> Ex-div date		September 16</p>
<p>NOTE - Chairman of financial services group Cattles Plc Peter Courtney said progress continues in all business sectors and company expects &quot;another successful year.&quot;</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
